# Same shape as birdlisten's: keep the image small, build cache stable.
.git
.github
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.env
.env.*
*.md
docs/
test_*.py
*_test.py
.pytest_cache
Dockerfile
compose.yaml
.dockerignore
.gitignore
models/
# Exception: the workflow's Unit tests step runs `python -m unittest
# discover -s tests` INSIDE the built image (see .github/workflows/build.yml).
# Excluding tests/ broke that step with "Start directory is not
# importable: 'tests'" (issue #12). The test file is stdlib-only and tiny,
# so shipping it costs nothing measurable.
!tests/test_packagedetector.py
!tests/test_capture.py
package-data/
